qACzZYaUI4523DJtVOo4EFht6zmiVHKyWD7Sslg-0\"/><figcaption>店內設有不同品牌展位、「PapaCafe」以及「PapaFa」花藝植物店。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店內設有不同品牌展位、「PapaCafe」以及「PapaFa」花藝植物店。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194700620385619968065187.jpeg/0Sc6Wx5I4SPseorHRSf8KJmsQuGlao-TnGSdnZxknZ0\"/><figcaption>店內設有不同品牌展位、「PapaCafe」以及「PapaFa」花藝植物店。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店內設有不同品牌展位、「PapaCafe」以及「PapaFa」花藝植物店。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194700624072544256549728.jpeg/gukpGDn52tmo_M-GXdpry7ff8Rlg2vEtEwVzdRMFc3U\"/><figcaption>店內設有不同品牌展位、「PapaCafe」以及「PapaFa」花藝植物店。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"店內設有不同品牌展位、「PapaCafe」以及「PapaFa」花藝植物店。（湯致遠攝）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261104/1194700581478993920037154.jpeg/0o7or5gY3uJA4GQ5jvnBghkLsx-FC02J6-6I0-vuiNM\"/><figcaption>店內設有不同品牌展位、「PapaCafe」以及「PapaFa」花藝植物店。（湯致遠攝）</figcaption></figure><p>設品牌快閃區</p><p>有別於傳統家俬店，旗艦店特設「淘寶品牌快閃區」。淘寶方面指出，平台雖有大量品牌，但不少優質商品未能讓本地消費者親身體驗，新店首階段將引入11個內地家居及生活品牌，涵蓋潮玩、箱包、鍋具及寵物用品等，並定期舉辦產品試用及工作坊，藉此增加消費者對內地新興品牌的認知與信任。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-04T11:05:29.274341+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":2074,"images":30,"source":"HK01 社會","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-04T09:47:51+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T11:58:51.007113+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-04T10:58:46.325994+00:00","content_hash":"abad7101366d0256b26a09aa78192741778b8aa40a5bf4b9ac21895221aacb23","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}